        "old_en": "Achieve victory condition 2 within 4 turns.\nAlong the way, shoot down 4 or more $$アンゲロイ・アルカ$$ units, and $$セツコ$$, $$ランド$$, $$クロウ$$ and ヒビキＡ must each shoot down 2 or more enemies.",
        "new_en": "Meet victory condition 2 within 4 turns.\nAlso shoot down 4+ $$アンゲロイ・アルカ$$; $$セツコ$$, $$ランド$$, $$クロウ$$ and ヒビキＡ must each down 2+ enemies.",
        "reasoning": "The existing meaning is accurate but its live composition exceeds the native 302-byte condition field. Shorten only this row: Achieve becomes Meet; 4 or more and 2 or more become 4+ and 2+; remove the redundant unit classifier after the mech name; use down for the second shootdown verb. Every requirement remains explicit.",
        "context": "Member 686 lists victory condition 2 as moving Setsuko, Rand, Crowe and the live protagonist to their respective target points. Its ordinary five-turn deadline is tightened by this SR condition to four turns. Defeat conditions also name these pilots and Simon and trigger at turn 6.",
        "requirements": [
          "Achieve victory condition 2.",
          "Deadline: within 4 turns.",
          "Shoot down at least 4 Angeloi Arca units.",
          "Setsuko, Rand, Crowe and the live protagonist must EACH shoot down at least 2 enemies."
        ],
